Review this grading helper for correctness and style: `def mean_score(reports):
    out = {}
    for r in reports:
        d = json.load(open(r))
        for k in d['by_skill']:
            out[k] = out.get(k, 0) + d['by_skill'][k]
    return {k: v / len(reports) for k, v in out.items()}`
